   BEEUE; Int Clean Energy Talent Program; UNiLAB},
Abstract = {With the reform of power marketization, the price of electricity will be
   deregulated. Under the independent pricing mechanism and the emergence
   of multiple operating subjects within virtual power plant (VPP), the
   traditional operation control methods of VPP and their price mechanisms
   are difficult to adapt to the new environment. A demand-response VPP
   optimize scheduling method based on competitive bidding equilibrium was
   proposed in the paper, which simulates the bidding progress in VPP and
   supports the interaction between virtual power plant and the traditional
   large power grid. During the operation of VPP, the difference price
   operation method is adopted, and the internal clearing price is
   determined based on the bidding of the local power supply resources and
   the price information of the large grid. The internal clearing price
   guides the optimal operation of virtual power plant. Finally, through an
   example analysis, the correctness of the proposed method and the cost
   optimization effect were verified. Copyright 2018 Elsevier Ltd. All
   rights reserved.},
