   Telecommun; Sci Direct Grp Ecoles Telecommun},
Abstract = {Smart spaces augment people's lives with ubiquitous computing technology
   that provides increased communications, awareness, and functionality.
   However, smart spaces pose many technical challenges in device
   interaction/integration, user/environment perception, system
   interoperability and scalability, as well as security/privacy/trust. In
   this paper, we first examine some key issues in smart spaces, then we
   propose a reference middleware architecture for smart spaces which can
   well address the identified issues. Implementation details of the
   middleware are presented.},
