   in chronic stages as the current standard of care may not provide
   precise personalized therapy for sensory perception, motor planning, or
   motor response deficits. This study evaluates the effects of
   personalized robotic balance training (RBT) prescribed using
   quantitative evaluation of balance deficits. Preliminary data are shown
   on the effects of personalized RBT on balance biomechanics in
   individuals with chronic TBI.},
