Abstract = {This article carried out the analysis of status of the current
   environmental emergency management policy in our country from multiple
   aspects including laws \& regulations, technical management, economic
   policies and social policies, etc. Compared international advanced
   management experience with conditions of our country, the insufficiency
   in environmental emergency management policy of our country was
   summarized, and the suggestions on systematization and compatibility of
   laws \& regulations, completeness of codes and standards for technical
   management policy, application of economic polices in emergency
   management and improvement of overall emergency management capability of
   the society were provided. It helped for providing decision-making
