   Univ, Nanchang, PEOPLES R CHINA, APR 23-25, 2010},
Organization = {Pan Asian Soc Sports \& Phys Educ},
Abstract = {Purpose In order to examine the relationship between the personality
   traits and training competition strategies of the elite golf players in
   China Method 14 golf players (including eight males and six females) of
   the Chinese Golf Team preparing for the Doha Asian Games were taken as
   the subjects of study SPSS was adopted for the analysis Results The
   results suggested that there is a significant relationship between the
   athletes character and the strategy of training and competition (p< 05),
   also the strategy of training has a significant relationship with the
   competition strategy (p< 05) Significant gender differences were found
   in some dimensions of the training strategy (automatization) and
   competition strategy (emotion control, negative thought) Conclusion
   based on the results, on the one hand, the coach should pay enough
   attention on mental training, and apply it in training, on the-other
   hand, athletes should persist in psychological skill practicing, and use
   the skill in golf training and competition From this way, the athletes'
   ability of adaptation the match can be improved},
