Title = {An analysis on Kenyahara and ``void{''} design concept of MUJI},
Booktitle = {INNOVATION, COMMUNICATION AND ENGINEERING},
Year = {2014},
Pages = {537-540},
Note = {2nd International Conference on Innovation, Communication and
   Engineering (ICICE), Qingdao, PEOPLES R CHINA, OCT 26-NOV 01, 2013},
Organization = {China Univ Petr; Taiwanese Inst Knowledge Innovat},
Abstract = {Kenyahara, a Japanese designer, who enjoys a brilliant reputation in
   contemporary art circle, acts a leading role in designing the brand
   ``MUJI{''}, and the brand is widely known for its magnificent oriental
   wisdom and strong Japanese characteristics worldwide. It creates a new
   life-style of nature, brief and simplicity in an age of economic
   globalization and technological development, spreads the oriental wisdom
   through the world. In the products of ``MUJI{''}, Kenyahara holds a
   design concept of ``Void{''}, strive for `` creating something out of
   nothing{''}. Kenyahara considers ``Void{''} the most beautiful design,
   giving people limitless space for imagination by ``Void{''}. The idea of
   ``Void{''} can be tracked back to the Taoism and Buddhism philosophy, it
   proves that Kenyahara's design concept is deeply influenced by Chinese
   culture. The Taoism book ``Tao Teh King{''} has mentioned the opinion ``
   Being and Not-being grow out of one another{''}, thinks that everything
   in universe is the combination of Being and Not-being. Zen Buddhism
   stands the ``Null{''} idea, Zen Teachers' dialogues are always concise
   and comprehensive, inflected the similar concept of ``Void{''} in art.
   This article has three parts to expound and discuss. In the
   Introduction, it brings out the design concept of ``Void{''} with its
   cultural origin and research significance. Then lists examples by MUJI's
   posters and products for two parts, explains the inflection of
   ``Void{''} concept. After that, it shows the influence from Kenyahara
   and the enlightenment for China's contemporary design environment: We
   should set up distinguished Chinese design style, and the core of design
   is culture. Finally, it looks forward to the future of China's design,
   attempts to find a way for Chinese artists to work better in
   indigenization design.},
