   morphology are reflected in different housing development projects,
   which rely heavily on a technical insight. In this context, this
   research aims to analyze the implantation and typologies of a low-income
   housing development located in the South of Brazil. Specifically, it was
   analyzed the layout and style of the studied housing development,
   relating these characteristics with water resource planning aiming in
   highlighting guidelines to assist in the system design and solutions for
   rainwater harvesting. It is believed that this research can provide
