Abstract = {The article deals with one of the most important problems in modern
   methodology: the problem of teaching to understand a written text. We
   discuss characteristics of such concepts as ``understanding{''},
   ``perception{''} and ``text{''}, as well as offer classifications of the
   structure of understanding. The article renders an analysis of
   techniques of understanding and their classification in relation to the
   lessons of the Russian language where analytical reading is taught. The
