Abstract = {In this review of the state of research on a particular type of crack
   growth, some philosophical, psychological and sociological aspects of
   the planning and performance of research on complex phenomena are dealt
   with, It is concluded that the complexity in question will require
   systematic interaction among researchers of different backgrounds with
   respect to their perceptions of the nature of the problem, their
