   Fdn; San Diego Univ; Univ California San Diego; Ajinomoto US Inc; Coca
   Cola Co; Firmenich SA; Glaxo Wellcome Res \& Dev Ltd; Int Flavors \&
   Fragrances Inc; Johnson \& Johnson; Kirin Brewery Co Ltd; Nutrisweet
   Kelco C0; Olfactory Res Fund; Pherin Corp; Proctor \& Gamble Co; Abbott
   Labs, Ross Prod Div; Soc Res Umami Taste; Unilever},
Abstract = {To visualize odor detection in individual cilia of olfactory sensory
   neurons we have developed a new approach by using high-resolution
   calcium imaging techniques. Laser scanning confocal microscopy revealed,
   for the first time, that odor stimuli induce transient Ca2+ elevations
   in single olfactory cilia. Pharmacological analysis indicates that these
   Ca2+ signals depend entirely on Ca2+ entry through activated cyclic
   nucleotide-gated (CNG) channels. This novel approach enables us to
   monitor the initial steps leading to olfactory perception in a spatially
   and temporally resolved manner.},
